{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/folder-layout","title":"Folder layout","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"folder-layout","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Folder layout"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every file of a CraftTS app has one folder it belongs in, and that folder is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"computed from the app's imports — not from file names, and not from where the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"file sits today. "},{"t":"code","text":"craft organize"},{"t":"text","text":" proposes the moves; two baseline architecture"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rules, "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-placement"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-layers"},{"t":"text","text":", keep the result in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"place."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-rule","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The rule"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A folder is chosen along two axes."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Scope — who uses the file."}]},{"t":"text","text":" The app shell and every module loaded by a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"loadChildren"},{"t":"text","text":" are "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"zones"}]},{"t":"text","text":". A zone reaches what its entry imports, statically"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"or through a "},{"t":"code","text":"loadComponent"},{"t":"text","text":", without crossing into another zone. "},{"t":"code","text":"main.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the shell's entry; a routes module is its feature's entry, named after the file"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"sessions.routes.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"sessions"},{"t":"text","text":"). Zones nest the way "},{"t":"code","text":"loadChildren"},{"t":"text","text":" calls"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nest."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Zones that reach the file"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Folder"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"the shell only"}],[{"t":"code","text":"app/"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"one feature only"}],[{"t":"code","text":"features/<feature>/"},{"t":"text","text":" ("},{"t":"code","text":"features/<parent>/<child>/"},{"t":"text","text":" when nested)"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"several zones whose closest common zone is a feature"}],[{"t":"code","text":"features/<feature>/shared/<layer>/"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"several zones whose closest common zone is the shell"}],[{"t":"code","text":"shared/<layer>/"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"main.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" stays where the bundler expects it. A file no entry reaches is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reported, and "},{"t":"code","text":"craft organize"},{"t":"text","text":" proposes deleting it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Layer — what the file is."}]},{"t":"text","text":" Its Craft nodes decide, in this order:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Layer"}],[{"t":"text","text":"The file declares"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"wiring"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a route, a route hook or check, an app config — or it is a zone entry"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"ui"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a component or template element, or it is a "},{"t":"code","text":"*.style.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" file"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"data-access"}],[{"t":"text","text":"an HTTP endpoint or a server-function client"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"state"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a service, a primitive, a source or a property"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"util"}],[{"t":"text","text":"none of the above: types and pure functions"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Imports point down: "},{"t":"code","text":"ui"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"data-access"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"util"},{"t":"text","text":". A file may import"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"its own layer or a layer below. "},{"t":"code","text":"wiring"},{"t":"text","text":" is exempt both ways, and "},{"t":"code","text":"import type"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"carries no dependency."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Groups."}]},{"t":"text","text":" Inside a zone's own folder, a file one level below the zone's pages"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that is the only way to reach at least three files (itself included) takes them"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"into a sub-folder named after it, without the zone prefix: in the "},{"t":"code","text":"replay"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"zone, "},{"t":"code","text":"replay-stage.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" and the timeline and thumbnails only it reaches go to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"features/replay/stage/"},{"t":"text","text":". Only one such level is created."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two consequences follow from the rule itself:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a feature never imports another feature's own file — such a file would be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reached by two zones, so it would be shared;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"shared/"},{"t":"text","text":" never imports a feature's own file, for the same reason."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"So the placement rule also enforces the boundaries between features."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"propose-the-moves","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Propose the moves"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craft","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"organize","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--graph","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-dependency-graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--out","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/folder-layout","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The command refuses an obsolete or invalid graph and never rebuilds it or moves"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"files. It writes "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-analysis.json"},{"t":"text","text":" (zones, layer violations, file"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"metrics), "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-proposal.json"},{"t":"text","text":" (one placement per file) and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"FOLDER_LAYOUT_REPORT.md"},{"t":"text","text":". "},{"t":"code","text":"--target-root"},{"t":"text","text":" places the proposed tree under"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"another folder than the project's "},{"t":"code","text":"src/"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Apply a reviewed proposal with "},{"t":"code","text":"craft organize apply"},{"t":"text","text":": it runs "},{"t":"code","text":"git mv"},{"t":"text","text":" for each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"move and rewrites the relative imports of every file in the project."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"keep-the-layout-with-architecture-rules","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep the layout with architecture rules"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"assertDeclarativeArchitecture"},{"t":"text","text":" runs both rules:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-placement"},{"t":"text","text":" reports each file that is not in its folder, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"each file no entry reaches;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-layers"},{"t":"text","text":" reports each import that points up the layers."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"They "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"warn by default"}]},{"t":"text","text":", so an app written before the rule keeps passing."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Once an app is reorganized, raise them in its architecture test:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"assertDeclarativeArchitecture","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph.graph, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  waivers: architectureWaiverList,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  severity: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"'folder-layout-placement'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'error'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"'folder-layout-layers'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'error'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Both rules name a "},{"t":"code","text":"file:<path>"},{"t":"text","text":" target, so a deliberate exception is waived per"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"file, with its reason:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"rule"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'folder-layout-layers'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"target"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'file:apps/shop/src/shared/util/labels.ts'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"reason"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Labels read the cart state; they move to craftComputed values next.'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"tune-an-organizer-run","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tune an organizer run"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The programmatic entry point is "},{"t":"code","text":"organizeProject"},{"t":"text","text":", exported by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools/folder-layout"},{"t":"text","text":". The layout itself"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is "},{"t":"code","text":"computeFolderLayout"},{"t":"text","text":", which the architecture rules call too."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { organizeProject } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/folder-layout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"organizeProject","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  project: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  graph: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'craft-dependency-graph.json'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  out: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'apps/shop/folder-layout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  thresholds: { groupMinFiles: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  placementRules: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      id: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'app-start-services'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      when: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        nodeKind: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'service'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        nodeDetails: { appStart: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      scope: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      folder: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'app/app-start'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      reason: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Runs during application bootstrap.'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"thresholds.groupMinFiles"},{"t":"text","text":" is the number of files a group needs (3 by default);"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"hubFanIn"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"hubFanOut"},{"t":"text","text":" mark hubs in the report. "},{"t":"code","text":"weights"},{"t":"text","text":" only rank the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"related files listed with each placement."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"keep-project-rules-in-json","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep project rules in JSON"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The CLI accepts the same "},{"t":"code","text":"weights"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"thresholds"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"placementRules"},{"t":"text","text":" in a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"JSON file passed with "},{"t":"code","text":"--config"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"placementRules\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"id\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"app-start-services\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"when\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"nodeKind\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"service\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"nodeDetails\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"appStart\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"scope\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"core\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"folder\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"app/app-start\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"reason\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"Runs during application bootstrap.\"","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ]","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"json","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craft","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"organize","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--graph","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-dependency-graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--config","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/organizer.config.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--out","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/folder-layout","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The organizer evaluates rules in array order, before the computed layout. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rule matches a file when at least one Craft graph node in that file has the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"selected "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeKind"},{"t":"text","text":" and all selected "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeDetails"},{"t":"text","text":" values. The first matching"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rule sets the file's scope and destination. "},{"t":"code","text":"folder"},{"t":"text","text":" is relative to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"organizer's target root, which defaults to the app's "},{"t":"code","text":"src/"},{"t":"text","text":" folder when"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"present."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rules need a unique "},{"t":"code","text":"id"},{"t":"text","text":", a "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeKind"},{"t":"text","text":", optional "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeDetails"},{"t":"text","text":", a scope"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"feature-local"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"parent-shared"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"global-shared"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"core"},{"t":"text","text":", or "},{"t":"code","text":"unresolved"},{"t":"text","text":"), a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"safe relative "},{"t":"code","text":"folder"},{"t":"text","text":", and a human-readable "},{"t":"code","text":"reason"},{"t":"text","text":". In TypeScript,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeKind"},{"t":"text","text":" narrows "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeDetails"},{"t":"text","text":"; for "},{"t":"code","text":"service"},{"t":"text","text":", keys and values are checked"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"against the service metadata ("},{"t":"code","text":"appStart"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"browserBoundary"},{"t":"text","text":" are booleans)."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The JSON CLI validates known service detail keys and value types at runtime."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The reason appears with the file's proposal. Resolved rules are written to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-analysis.json"},{"t":"text","text":" and contribute to the proposal's "},{"t":"code","text":"configHash"},{"t":"text","text":", so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"changing policy produces a distinct review artifact. A matching explicit rule"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"has confidence "},{"t":"code","text":"1"},{"t":"text","text":"; destination collisions still require review."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A placement rule only changes what "},{"t":"code","text":"craft organize"},{"t":"text","text":" proposes. The"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-placement"},{"t":"text","text":" rule checks the computed layout, so a file a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"placement rule moves elsewhere needs a waiver."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"file-level-behavior","children":[{"t":"text","text":"File-level behavior"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The organizer proposes moves for whole files. If one service in a file matches"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a rule, the entire file receives that placement. Keep declarations with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"different folder policies in separate files. If several rules match a file,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the first rule wins; put narrower matchers first."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"demo-policy-app-start-services","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Demo policy: app-start services"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The dependency graph records "},{"t":"code","text":"appStart: true"},{"t":"text","text":" on Craft service nodes. The demo"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"uses that fact in "},{"t":"code","text":"apps/demo/organizer.config.json"},{"t":"text","text":" to place matching source"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"files under "},{"t":"code","text":"src/core/app-start/"},{"t":"text","text":". This policy is passed only by the demo's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"attest:demo:folder-layout"},{"t":"text","text":" command, so it does not change the organizer's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"defaults for other applications."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"To regenerate the proposal:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"attest:demo:folder-layout","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The command refreshes the read-only analysis and proposal artifacts. Apply a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"proposal separately with "},{"t":"code","text":"craft organize apply"},{"t":"text","text":" after reviewing it."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-rule","text":"The rule"},{"level":2,"id":"propose-the-moves","text":"Propose the moves"},{"level":2,"id":"keep-the-layout-with-architecture-rules","text":"Keep the layout with architecture rules"},{"level":2,"id":"tune-an-organizer-run","text":"Tune an organizer run"},{"level":2,"id":"keep-project-rules-in-json","text":"Keep project rules in JSON"},{"level":3,"id":"file-level-behavior","text":"File-level behavior"},{"level":2,"id":"demo-policy-app-start-services","text":"Demo policy: app-start services"}]}